      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk it doesn't feel like a big deal, just some light itching on my arms. i've taken caffeine before when i felt a bit off and it's fine. i just wanna know if the double scoop of pre-workout is gonna mess with the allergy or if it's safe to go. i'm mostly just worried about the energy dip mid-set.",
